# #390 pre-wave GPU evidence — raw trainer output behind the README's
# "GPU evidence" table. elisa, RTX 4090, 2026-08-01. Both GPUs were shared
# with unrelated jobs, so absolute sps is only comparable within a pair run
# back to back on the same GPU.
#
# Config: the arm6_v2 / arm5 cell command lines from scripts/run_arm.sh,
# 200 backbone steps, T=4096, d_model=64, 3 encoder + 3 layers, bs=64,
# SIGReg on, CPC aux on, EMA teacher (tau=0.9), seed=20260520,
# jeremycochoy/gift-pretrain-full-4096 / small_v1.

